docker-bake.hcl
.venv
.ruff_cache
Dockerfile.bake
**/Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
# Local secrets. Compose auto-loads a `.env` beside its compose file, so images built
# from the repo root would otherwise bake one in (the scaled-evals stack keeps its
# credential encryption key there). Exact name only: the Studio image builds from
# checked-in `web/packages/studio/env/.env.<name>` files.
.env
**/.env
**/__pycache__
**/node_modules
web/packages/sdk/generated/
sdk/python/nemo-helix/_dev/nhx
# nemo-agents optimize-skills artifacts. These ephemeral run outputs can
# contain root-owned files (the harbor agent runs as root inside the
# container) that fail docker build context scanning with permission
# denied; they're also pure noise in the build context regardless.
jobs/
runs/
baselines/
loop_state*.json
.agent-improver-state*.json
